	(text "SLOW-SIGNAL MUX -> ADCIND4"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 75.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "005c0f4b-5e40-571f-91ba-34ec6ddcc296")
	)
	(text "120k/10k: 24 V reads 1.85 V, full scale 32.5 V; 100 nF filter.\n+24V is live before VDDA: the BAT54S holds the ball at VDDA + VF (7.10.1.4.2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.16 116.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0b3c90cc-4c7f-5bd8-8685-d3642fc88f48")
	)
	(text "AGND - GND STAR POINT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 251.232 75.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3a2703c3-72b0-550b-9513-b291cbbbe526")
	)
	(text "Single connection of the analog return to board ground (layout: under U301)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 251.232 99.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5ba1aa24-c779-591e-923e-0a2c462deb98")
	)
	(text "VMID AND VBIAS BUFFERS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.696 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "66850a1d-936c-5d22-b108-7986fb2c0742")
	)
	(text "VMID = VREF/2 is ratiometric: a zero differential input reads mid-scale whatever the reference error.\nVBIAS = VREF buffered, so ID and NTC readings are ratiometric and the reference itself is not loaded."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.696 59.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8b25e7e7-5b6c-5e35-a755-e253d625c2af")
	)
	(text "S1-S4 = C1-C4 NTC, S5-S8 = C1-C4 ID (24 ADC balls cannot take 20 fast channels + 9 slow ones).\nEach input has its own 100 nF on the cell sheet; the mux only switches between charged caps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 125.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8f105cce-a874-59b3-bbfd-d6c37a2c1d4f")
	)
	(text "Powered from +3V3A (VIN >= VOUT + 0.2 V) so VREFHI and VDAC can never exceed VDDA (SPRSP14E 7.11.2.3.5,\n7.11.3.1.4). Also the CMPSS DAC reference (VDAC, INT-05): thresholds ratiometric with the ADC.\nLoad 4.2 mA of +/-10 mA: VDAC 8 x 6 k (3.3 mA) + VREFHI 4 x 190 uA + VMID divider (asserted).\nNR 0.1 uF class 1; 1 uF HF at VOUT; VREFHI and VDAC capacitors are on the decoupling sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 63.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b1decbf8-48c2-5d99-83fc-b4ea5c3efcef")
	)
